Note (G1): Galactic environment code as follows:
            1.0 = Center
            2.0 = Bar
            3.0 = Bar
            5.0 = Spiral Arm
            6.0 = Spiral Arm
            4.0 = Interarm
            7.0 = Interarm
            8.0 = Interarm
            9.0 = Disc
           10.0 = Disc
